## Keep hidden entities and relationships when unmapping

Context:
After an unmap, new red ("not mapped") relationships appeared and hidden (grey)
entities/relationships were lost. An exclusion (`excluded`, `excluded_attributes`)
lives on the same entry as the SQL mapping, so every unmap path that spliced the
entry out of `MappingState.config` also un-hid the item; relationships attached
to a no-longer-excluded entity then turned red. "Unmap all" posted an empty
config to `/mapping/save` and `/mapping/clear` wiped every exclusion
server-side, so all hidden items came back red (and the loss was persisted,
which also explains seeing them red on a later first load).
Behaviour change: "Unmap all" now keeps exclusions (it used to clear them).

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/mapping/reset.py (new)
   - `exclusion_stubs()` reduces entries to key + label + exclusion flags.
   - `reset_mappings(domain, keep_exclusions)` deletes the mappings and, when
     asked, keeps those stubs. Extracted from `Mapping` (size-budget ratchet).
2. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   - `reset_mapping(keep_exclusions=False)` delegates to `reset_mappings`.
3. src/api/routers/internal/mapping.py
   - `POST /mapping/reset` and `POST /mapping/clear` accept
     `keep_exclusions` (default `false`, so existing callers are unchanged).
4. src/front/static/global/js/mapping-core.js
   - New shared `unmapMappingEntry()`: removes a plain mapping, or reduces an
     entry carrying exclusions to a stub (key, label, empty SQL, exclusions).
5. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js,
   src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-manual.js,
   src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-entity-modal.js,
   src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-relationship-modal.js
   - All 8 unmap paths (panel reset, context menu, manual list reset, modal
     remove) use `unmapMappingEntry()` instead of splicing.
6. src/front/static/global/js/mapping-information.js
   - `resetAllMappings()` no longer posts an empty config; it calls
     `/mapping/clear?keep_exclusions=true`, reloads `/mapping/load`, and
     re-stamps excluded flags. Confirm dialog says hidden items stay hidden.
7. tests/units/mapping/test_mapping_reset_keeps_exclusions.py (new),
   tests/units/front/test_mapping_unmap_keeps_exclusions.py (new)
   - Backend reset behaviour, endpoint flag, helper behaviour under node,
     "Unmap all" call sequence, and a guard against new splice sites.
8. docs/api.md, docs/user-guide.md
   - Documented `keep_exclusions` and the new unmap behaviour.

